(EWayServicePageController); GTK: the service page of eway_wizard.blp
(docs/eway.md §2.6, written in T7). The eWay-CRM assistant's first page,
laid out as the Jira assistant's site page (JiraSitePage.xaml): the banner
across the top, then a scrolling column clamped to 480 px with 24 px
